; V-Guard Sentinel AI Core - AutoCAD script (2D plan + 3D massing)
; USAGE: AutoCAD -> type SCRIPT -> select this file.  Units = mm.
; Blank lines are intentional (they act as Enter to finish commands).
; For the full parametric/dimensioned version use sentinel-ai-core.lsp or open the .dxf.
_.-LAYER _M ENCLOSURE _C 7 ENCLOSURE _M PCB _C 3 PCB _M HOLES _C 1 HOLES _M COMP _C 5 COMP _M DIM _C 8 DIM

_.-LAYER _S ENCLOSURE

_.RECTANG 0,0 95,70
_.-LAYER _S PCB

_.RECTANG 7.5,5 87.5,65
_.-LAYER _S HOLES

_.CIRCLE 4,4 1.75
_.CIRCLE 91,4 1.75
_.CIRCLE 4,66 1.75
_.CIRCLE 91,66 1.75
_.-LAYER _S COMP

_.RECTANG 11.5,44 31.5,62
_.RECTANG 67,44 83,62
_.RECTANG 11.5,16 29.5,28
_.RECTANG 33,16 49,28
_.RECTANG 51,16 61,26
_.RECTANG 63,16 81,32
_.-LAYER _S DIM

_.DIMLINEAR 0,0 95,0 47,-12
_.DIMLINEAR 0,0 0,70 -12,35
_.-LAYER _S ENCLOSURE

_.BOX 0,120,0 95,190,35
_.ZOOM _E
